Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T13:16:50-07:00","id":1083636,"title":"","content":"Maybe I'll do it that way. The w20 Wild West book is pretty clear you needed to be rank six to be sacrificed though. Though Garou natures seems to generate heroes when needed like the apocalypse generation, but this seems like it should most definitely have more of an impact on Garou history... it's more severe then the Russian and Amazon Wars!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T16:43:24-07:00","id":1083749,"title":"","content":"Keep in mind that &quot;Rank 6&quot; isn't really the same thing as the other Ranks. There's no Rite to make it happen. There's now specific Renown level. It's a purely status based reward. You're not just Elder Rank, you're the cream of the crop Elder Rank.<br /> <br /> Simply accepting the duty to be sacrificed could potentially put an Elder to Legendary if you want to think of it that way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T17:19:09-07:00","id":1083757,"title":"","content":"Sacrifice is to be expected though, of all Garou but especially elders. 6th rank go above and beyond and you need to have no doubts about them being 6th rank, which is why I don't think Albrecht should be 6th rank.<br /> <br /> They also have access to hella potent 6th rank gifts which can turn the tides of war.<br /> <br /> I houserule they can alsor raise traits to 6.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T17:55:10-07:00","id":1083763,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1083352-wait-13-6th-rank-garou-were-sacrificed-to-stop-the-stormeater?p=1083749#post1083749\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Keep in mind that &quot;Rank 6&quot; isn't really the same thing as the other Ranks. There's no Rite to make it happen. There's now specific Renown level.</div> </div> </div> </div>From the books, you have to have 10 dots in each category.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> It's a purely status based reward. You're not just Elder Rank, you're the cream of the crop Elder Rank.<br /> <br /> Simply accepting the duty to be sacrificed could potentially put an Elder to Legendary if you want to think of it that way. </div> </div> </div>And the other legends agree to give you a task to let you in.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T20:26:12-07:00","id":1083795,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>&quot;W20. page 253</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">The attainment of the Legend Rank has nothing whatsoever to do with rules \u2014 it\u2019s purely a matter of personal judgment on your part, and if there\u2019s any doubt in your mind whether or not she has surpassed the mighty deeds of even the greatest of Elders, she hasn\u2019t.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, there are some guidelines for the process, but the only mechanical one W20 presents is something that is elsewhere capable of being done by the spirits/ST fiat instead of Garou if no Garou is around for it and it is obvious enough that it should happen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-04T01:46:59-07:00","id":1087575,"title":"","content":"I'd just interpret it s 13 Legendary Elders, not necessarily 13 Rank 6s.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-04T02:51:14-07:00","id":1087592,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1083352-wait-13-6th-rank-garou-were-sacrificed-to-stop-the-stormeater?p=1087575#post1087575\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd just interpret it s 13 Legendary Elders, not necessarily 13 Rank 6s.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Page 10 specifically calls out 6th rank though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]