ate":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-11T13:03:00-07:00","id":1091238,"title":"","content":"My response?<br /> <br /> &quot;Garou exaggerate to the point of outright lying about their heroic accomplishments? THE WYRM YOU SAY!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-11T17:07:57-07:00","id":1091340,"title":"","content":"I view it as - the information was a lie, as in however it was gained it was a falshood; the ritual did *not* require 13 rank 6 Garou to work, but someone or something wanted the Garou to believe that was the case. But also, and conversely, the Garou were able to bluff and bluster and send heroes who weren't actually rank 6. And then the ritual succeeded, and the source of the misinformation is gobsmacked cuz holy shit the Garou actually *had* and *sacrificed* 13 rank 6ers and exultant cuz now the Garou had 13 fewer rank 6ers and more discord sown etc, while the Garou were sad at the loss of 13 heroes, and silently gobsmacked their various bluffs about hero Such-n-such being rank 6 worked.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/ofii86boiyk38ng/DtDRandomForms.zip\" target=\"_blank\">Open the gates of Hell: Random Demon Generator.</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1X6qQzoAPrSRNzl3cQcMWasoPv3eK56sIlAOTeay61No/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Gather an army of Rage! Random Garou Generator.</a><br /> Shapeshifting Historian<br /> Writer - Werewolf: the Apocalypse, Werewolf: the Forsaken, Exalted 3e, TC: \u00c6on","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/167-nikink","name":"nikink","avatar":"d